{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34268","headline":"丁隐君歌 · 陆龟蒙","name":"丁隐君歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"华阳道士南游归，手中半卷青萝衣。\n自言逋客持赠我，乃是钱搪丁翰之。\n连江大抵多奇岫，独话君家最奇秀。\n盘烧天竺春笋肥，琴倚洞庭秋石瘦。\n草堂暗引龙泓溜，老树根株若蹲兽。\n霜浓果熟未容收，往往儿童杂猨狖。\n去岁猖狂有黄寇，官军解散无人鬬。\n满城奔迸翰之闲，只把枯松塞圭窦。\n前度相逢正卖文，一钱不直虚云云。\n今来利作采樵客，可以抛身麋鹿羣。\n丁隐君，丁隐君，叩头且莫变名氏，即日更寻丁隐君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34268.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34268","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}